{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":232,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":38159,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1454844,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":229621,"Name":"marichu77","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229621.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1305822452,"LastPoster":{"Id":283079,"Name":"MandyJones","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283079.jpg?_r=1431458893","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":44,"Preview":{"Id":1454844,"PostDate":1305822452,"PostContent":"I think I spent the most time on the OOT bags for this upcoming wedding. It took forever to fina...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marichu_edmilao@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1277667097,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229621.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marichu77","Id":229621,"Name":"marichu77","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61226,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":9,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f565b778a759354ee7e6dab8fcb180f1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I think I spent the most time on the OOT bags for this upcoming wedding. It took forever to finally decide on what bags I wanted, and then it took months to gather all the items I wanted as the contents of the bags. Plus it didn&#039;t help that I wasn&#039;t sure exactly how many people were going. But all the RSVPs are in, the final headcount is done. And here it is:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I got the bags from a wholesaler on ebay:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"001.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429831\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"002.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429833\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I got the first aid kits ($1 each) &amp;nbsp;from medco.com and almost all the meds that I packed in there were from medco.com as well.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"006.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429835\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is the template for the label on the first aid kit. I just bought a whole sheets of label paper from Staples and printed on them. Then I used a paper cutter to cut each label and attached them to the first aid kit.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;9641&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Wedding Survival Kit.ppt&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;760&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;ppt&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"007.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429837\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here are the packets all in the first aid kit: I got Advil, Emergen-C, Pepto Bismol, Tylenol (not from medco), Imodium A-D (the blistore packs), and LifeSavers candy (from CVS)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"003.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429839\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I got the idea for the Imodium A-D envelope from another bride on BDW but I can&#039;t remember who! They look really cute.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"004.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429841\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is the template for it and the safety info that I inserted as well:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;9638&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;imodium AD envelopes.ppt&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;102&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;ppt&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;9639&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;imodium safety info.ppt&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;74&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;ppt&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I also bought some antibacterial hand gel from Bath and Body when they were on sale for about .69 cents each, some lip balm from Avon when they were also on sale (pink for the ladies and just white ones for the guys), tissue packets that one of my mom&#039;s co-workers got at a dollar store (9 packets of tissue sold for $1), Shout wipes from medco.com. I placed them all in ziplock \"biohazard\" bags that I was able to get from people who work in hospitals, and topped it off with a camouflaged label that I printed out using cardstock. Here&#039;s the finished survival kit product:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"001.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429859\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here&#039;s the template for the bag topper. I&#039;m not sure if the background camouflage image and the \"Survival Kit\" font will show up. In any case, you can download the font in dafont.com. The font&#039;s name is \"Steamer\".&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;9643&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;survival kit bag.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;957&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Included are also yellow and gray pashminas which I bought from Pioneer Group in downtown NYC. They were 12 for $26. Not shown are rolled up handkerchiefs for the men. All the tags were made by me by printing on cardstock and then using a 2-inch round cutter to make each tag. I used a paper cutter with rectangular holes to thread the ribbon onto each side of the tag.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"001.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429877\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/3.bp.blogspot.com\/-ZS8BTZEMryg\/TapYtw_fJAI\/AAAAAAAAA4A\/oqTfSPB7Htk\/s400\/004.JPG\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is the template for the pashmina tags:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;span huddler_attributes=\"{&amp;quot;plugin&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;attachment&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;params&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;id&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;9645&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;name&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;pashminalabel.doc&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;description&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;size&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;43&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;doc&amp;quot;}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I also have water guns that I bought from Oriental Trading (25 for $10) and playing cards that I got from a wholesaler in downtown NY ($6 for 10). Ignore the pink pashmina in the picture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/2.bp.blogspot.com\/-1U-2Ju4Xwz8\/TZuOMTDfX4I\/AAAAAAAAA3I\/sxqu5A1xcSg\/s400\/002.JPG\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Finally, there&#039;s the welcome letter that I will place in the front pocket of each bag. The petal enclosure and paper were all from Paper Source. The twine was from Michael&#039;s. I will also be placing a travel brochure and wedding timeline in the bag but I still have to finish designing it on VistaPrint.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/4.bp.blogspot.com\/-_-9BDAdtxYU\/TdSt125mnDI\/AAAAAAAAA5I\/c6TIYwJiUfg\/s400\/001.JPG\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/2.bp.blogspot.com\/-nJzF44Scy1U\/TdSuERb2gOI\/AAAAAAAAA5Y\/6kWVAj3CQyw\/s400\/003.JPG\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And that&#039;s it! I hope this helps someone out!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1454844,"PostDate":1305822452,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I think I spent the most time on the OOT bags for this upcoming wedding. It took forever to finally decide on what bags I wanted, and then it took months to gather all the items I wanted as the contents of the bags. Plus it didn't help that I wasn't sure exactly how many people were going. But all the RSVPs are in, the final headcount is done. And here it is:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I got the bags from a wholesaler on ebay:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"001.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429831\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"002.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429833\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I got the first aid kits ($1 each) \u00a0from medco.com and almost all the meds that I packed in there were from medco.com as well.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"006.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429835\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is the template for the label on the first aid kit. I just bought a whole sheets of label paper from Staples and printed on them. Then I used a paper cutter to cut each label and attached them to the first aid kit.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"9641\",\"name\":\"Wedding Survival Kit.ppt\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"760\",\"type\":\"ppt\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"007.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429837\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here are the packets all in the first aid kit: I got Advil, Emergen-C, Pepto Bismol, Tylenol (not from medco), Imodium A-D (the blistore packs), and LifeSavers candy (from CVS)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"003.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429839\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I got the idea for the Imodium A-D envelope from another bride on BDW but I can't remember who! They look really cute.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"004.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429841\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is the template for it and the safety info that I inserted as well:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"9638\",\"name\":\"imodium AD envelopes.ppt\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"102\",\"type\":\"ppt\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"9639\",\"name\":\"imodium safety info.ppt\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"74\",\"type\":\"ppt\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also bought some antibacterial hand gel from Bath and Body when they were on sale for about .69 cents each, some lip balm from Avon when they were also on sale (pink for the ladies and just white ones for the guys), tissue packets that one of my mom's co-workers got at a dollar store (9 packets of tissue sold for $1), Shout wipes from medco.com. I placed them all in ziplock \"biohazard\" bags that I was able to get from people who work in hospitals, and topped it off with a camouflaged label that I printed out using cardstock. Here's the finished survival kit product:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"001.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429859\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here's the template for the bag topper. I'm not sure if the background camouflage image and the \"Survival Kit\" font will show up. In any case, you can download the font in dafont.com. The font's name is \"Steamer\".<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"9643\",\"name\":\"survival kit bag.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"957\",\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Included are also yellow and gray pashminas which I bought from Pioneer Group in downtown NYC. They were 12 for $26. Not shown are rolled up handkerchiefs for the men. All the tags were made by me by printing on cardstock and then using a 2-inch round cutter to make each tag. I used a paper cutter with rectangular holes to thread the ribbon onto each side of the tag.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"001.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/429877\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/3.bp.blogspot.com\/-ZS8BTZEMryg\/TapYtw_fJAI\/AAAAAAAAA4A\/oqTfSPB7Htk\/s400\/004.JPG\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is the template for the pashmina tags:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"9645\",\"name\":\"pashminalabel.doc\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"43\",\"type\":\"doc\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also have water guns that I bought from Oriental Trading (25 for $10) and playing cards that I got from a wholesaler in downtown NY ($6 for 10). Ignore the pink pashmina in the picture.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/2.bp.blogspot.com\/-1U-2Ju4Xwz8\/TZuOMTDfX4I\/AAAAAAAAA3I\/sxqu5A1xcSg\/s400\/002.JPG\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Finally, there's the welcome letter that I will place in the front pocket of each bag. The petal enclosure and paper were all from Paper Source. The twine was from Michael's. I will also be placing a travel brochure and wedding timeline in the bag but I still have to finish designing it on VistaPrint.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/4.bp.blogspot.com\/-_-9BDAdtxYU\/TdSt125mnDI\/AAAAAAAAA5I\/c6TIYwJiUfg\/s400\/001.JPG\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/2.bp.blogspot.com\/-nJzF44Scy1U\/TdSuERb2gOI\/AAAAAAAAA5Y\/6kWVAj3CQyw\/s400\/003.JPG\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And that's it! I hope this helps someone out!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marichu_edmilao@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1277667097,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229621.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marichu77","Id":229621,"Name":"marichu77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61226,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d535dcb6774dbd78ee458f98c18bb6c","RawContent":"Wow, everything looks great. I love the package for the Immodium!","Attachments":[],"Id":1454976,"PostDate":1305837971,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow, everything looks great. I love the package for the Immodium!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennifer.piasecki@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1287692203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233397.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"muzikgrrl","Id":233397,"Name":"muzikgrrl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61226,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f800d97be212c0667785eec7ee8c121","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; WOW! Love your bag, you did an amazing job!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1455023,"PostDate":1305840888,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> WOW! Love your bag, you did an amazing job!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Hard Rock Punta Cana May 12, 2012<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cmontankb@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1303569312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239192.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LalaJ","Id":239192,"Name":"LalaJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61226,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85c8ee3dc695b64a5f1a2040e6c879a8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Can you come make mine &lt;span alt=\";)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" \/&gt; I&#039;m at the point that they need to be made but I&#039;ve lost some motivation.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\";)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\"&gt;They are lovely!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1455026,"PostDate":1305841320,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Can you come make mine <span alt=\";)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" \/><\/span> I'm at the point that they need to be made but I've lost some motivation.<\/span><\/p> <p> <span alt=\";)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\">They are lovely!<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerriblaine@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295058404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235559.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kerrib","Id":235559,"Name":"kerrib","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61226,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5e8d7b3d05bbb178e5dfdf4d2668c36","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; love love love the pashminas \"to have and to hold in case you get cold\" I may borrow that one!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1455036,"PostDate":1305841923,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> love love love the pashminas \"to have and to hold in case you get cold\" I may borrow that one!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>November 26th 2011 - Gran Bahai Principe Jamacia<\/span><br><span>Booked: 31 Adults + 5 children + Bride and Groom!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"melissa_prior@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299791207,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237667.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missmeliss","Id":237667,"Name":"missmeliss","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61226,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f3acec115245e220df3d81a872ab683","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; You did SUCH a great job!! It&#039;s all so beachy, yet classy  :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[]