f Honor?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1479624,"PostDate":1309516000,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> So I haven't found a recent post on this! What is everyone getting for their bridesmaids and Maid of Honor?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"way2radd4u@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.228.88.117","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1294693966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235366.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LovesJakeyPoo","Id":235366,"Name":"LovesJakeyPoo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b39553dccc3de4fcb1a4ca1d01e35fd5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are paying for their dresses, hair, jewelry and makeup, so we are only going for small gifts.&amp;nbsp; I got them passport covers off etsy and flip cameras.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1480289,"PostDate":1309644230,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are paying for their dresses, hair, jewelry and makeup, so we are only going for small gifts.\u00a0 I got them passport covers off etsy and flip cameras.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jkergen@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"137.186.71.240","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1293141900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234788.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JayKay","Id":234788,"Name":"JayKay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5b9e93bbd2accfef131ccedc4e7d6ac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have necklaces for them made with turquoise colored swarvoski (sp??) crystals I got from ebay.. I got one for all of them plus my Mom and future mother in law, and me! I figure I will give these out at the bridal shower or sometime before the day&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I got flasks done for the wedding party from ebay - if you are considering personalized flasks PLEASE search ebay first, they do a great job and you will find similar flasks for like $25-40 on other wedding sites and in engraving stores.. and these were like 8 bucks, personalization included...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Umm.. oh I got my girls custom made wristlets from etsy seller FrankieLloyd -&amp;nbsp;they are embroidered on the inside with their initials, again I got one for myself and one for my mom and future mother in law.. lol&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am also thinking of little clutches from etsy seller Vanijja, but I haven&#039;t ordered those yet...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I got little Kate Spade flip flop manicure sets too.. and pashminas.. as we get closer to the date if I manage to pay off all of our wedding and trip stuff early, I would like to be able to help them with stuff like shoes and attire but I think everyones thinking they&#039;re going to pay for their dress, which I don&#039;t want them to spend a lot of money on and they can all be different as long as theyre the same color, so they can use them again :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1480305,"PostDate":1309645877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have necklaces for them made with turquoise colored swarvoski (sp??) crystals I got from ebay.. I got one for all of them plus my Mom and future mother in law, and me! I figure I will give these out at the bridal shower or sometime before the day<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I got flasks done for the wedding party from ebay - if you are considering personalized flasks PLEASE search ebay first, they do a great job and you will find similar flasks for like $25-40 on other wedding sites and in engraving stores.. and these were like 8 bucks, personalization included...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Umm.. oh I got my girls custom made wristlets from etsy seller FrankieLloyd -\u00a0they are embroidered on the inside with their initials, again I got one for myself and one for my mom and future mother in law.. lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am also thinking of little clutches from etsy seller Vanijja, but I haven't ordered those yet...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I got little Kate Spade flip flop manicure sets too.. and pashminas.. as we get closer to the date if I manage to pay off all of our wedding and trip stuff early, I would like to be able to help them with stuff like shoes and attire but I think everyones thinking they're going to pay for their dress, which I don't want them to spend a lot of money on and they can all be different as long as theyre the same color, so they can use them again <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>~Married aboard the cruise ship the <\/span><strong>'Carnival Dream'<\/strong><span>~<\/span><br><span>~Carnival Dream Wedding April 28th, 2012, then set sail on a 7 night Caribbean Cruise April 28th-May 5th, 2012~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"symbol_J@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1301244615,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238250.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":154,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DramaticAnnie","Id":238250,"Name":"DramaticAnnie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94e36f2016f4206600abaa0ac51d842e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I got our bridal party Tiffany Starfish Earrings, Ralph Lauren Beach towels, and tanks made with their name and role from www.bridalpartytees.com. Body wash\/lotion sets from bath and body works.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For the guys they got personalized flasks and NFL shirts with their favorite team and we bought their ties for the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Moms got tshirts and a spa robe.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My dad got a flask too, hankerchief with a dad\/daughter message and an NFL t-shirt.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1480495,"PostDate":1309696422,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I got our bridal party Tiffany Starfish Earrings, Ralph Lauren Beach towels, and tanks made with their name and role from www.bridalpartytees.com. Body wash\/lotion sets from bath and body works.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For the guys they got personalized flasks and NFL shirts with their favorite team and we bought their ties for the wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Moms got tshirts and a spa robe.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My dad got a flask too, hankerchief with a dad\/daughter message and an NFL t-shirt.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>09-10-11<\/span><br><span>Runaway Bay, Jamaica<\/span><br><span>I married my best friend!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"valerie_tynes@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1297795868,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236836.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cupcake1382","Id":236836,"Name":"cupcake1382","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f49d2165bc4a9916c4c97c61a9fd09ab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; good ideas guys!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1482822,"PostDate":1310066860,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> good ideas guys!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"way2radd4u@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.228.88.117","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1294693966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235366.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LovesJakeyPoo","Id":235366,"Name":"LovesJakeyPoo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb5fa2b03357938f588d93c0be1b922c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; looks like I need to check out etsy more carefully!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1482823,"PostDate":1310066898,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> looks like I need to check out etsy more carefully!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"way2radd4u@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.228.88.117","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1294693966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235366.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LovesJakeyPoo","Id":235366,"Name":"LovesJakeyPoo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e72bf1e73e2b97f4ef049e4590ccbac8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Ladies!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The brides I&#039;m working with have loved the idea of custom barefoot jewels, earrings &amp;amp; bracelets...just a thought! Everything can be customized by color and style and lots of love is incorporated into each piece :) I know this as a designer AND as a former destination wedding bride last year. My girls were brought to tears with their jewels!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cheers!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1482834,"PostDate":1310067844,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Ladies!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The brides I'm working with have loved the idea of custom barefoot jewels, earrings & bracelets...just a thought! Everything can be customized by color and style and lots of love is incorporated into each piece <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I know this as a designer AND as a former destination wedding bride last year. My girls were brought to tears with their jewels!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Cheers!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245201937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"24a22e594a0f2baf7bcdd862952458c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m really looking for anklets. Maybe silver with a small starfish? Has anyone seen ones like this? Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1496430,"PostDate":1312192174,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm really looking for anklets. Maybe silver with a small starfish? Has anyone seen ones like this? Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jwed12@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1296984623,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236433.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":292,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jwed12","Id":236433,"Name":"Jwed12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1724d79c24d564f1e87baf0f6fef740","RawContent":"Hi Jwed12! I&#039;d be more than happy to customize anklets for your bridesmaids if you&#039;re interested. We could customize by color\/style and I can definitely order special starfish charms. If you&#039;re interested please email me at redibychelsea@gmail.com. Thanks!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Jwed12[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;m really looking for anklets. Maybe silver with a small starfish? Has anyone seen ones like this? Thanks![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1496572,"PostDate":1312200973,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Jwed12! I'd be more than happy to customize anklets for your bridesmaids if you're interested. We could customize by color\/style and I can definitely order special starfish charms. If you're interested please email me at redibychelsea@gmail.com. Thanks!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Jwed12<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I'm really looking for anklets. Maybe silver with a small starfish? Has anyone seen ones like this? Thanks!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245201937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62071,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17c696a95d69719831ccf36e3c5cbefd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I love the barefoor jewelry idea!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1496584,"PostDate":1312201899,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I love the barefoor jewelry idea!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brenda.m.abreu@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295876224,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235937.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":201,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"brendee2005","Id":235937,"Name":"brendee2005","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"62071","Title":"Bridesmaid gift","LastPostDate":1435924382},"Pages":{"TotalItems":74,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
