{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":61,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":3335,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1883866,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1422026739,"LastPoster":{"Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":39,"Preview":{"Id":1898252,"PostDate":1433859512,"PostContent":"I think the Garmin ones are really pricey and you usually dont use all of the available functiona...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~*~YYCBRIDE2016~*~<\/p><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79227-yycbride2016-grand-sirenis-planning-thread-february-2016\/'>My planning thread\u00a0<\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;484\/st\/20160223\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/4bd8\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a><br>\u00a0","Email":"janellepaquin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.216.37","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1432083304,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283167.jpg?_r=1432133572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"yycbride2016","Id":283167,"Name":"yycbride2016","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.54.141.252","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bff124346dda1a179d411bcdb9701a07","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Any 2015\/2016 Brides using MyfitnessPal app \/ website to loose weight before the wedding?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m using it and I have lost 5 Lbs since I started keeping track on Jan 5th. Now I&#039;m starting to lose focus as I get busier and I&#039;m looking for&amp;nbsp;friends&amp;nbsp;with like minded goals to keep me&amp;nbsp;motivated. Going to pick up the Fitbit Charge HR today after work to see if that will help as well.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m not much of a \"Crazy Diet\", \"Supplements\" or \"Crazy&amp;nbsp;Cleanse\" type person...I&#039;m on a eat right (sort of..most of the time..) and exercise kind of thing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone feels like joining or is already a member we could start a Best Destination Group and inspire each other to \"start sweating for the wedding\"&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.myfitnesspal.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.myfitnesspal.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883866,"PostDate":1422026739,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Any 2015\/2016 Brides using MyfitnessPal app \/ website to loose weight before the wedding?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm using it and I have lost 5 Lbs since I started keeping track on Jan 5th. Now I'm starting to lose focus as I get busier and I'm looking for\u00a0friends\u00a0with like minded goals to keep me\u00a0motivated. Going to pick up the Fitbit Charge HR today after work to see if that will help as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm not much of a \"Crazy Diet\", \"Supplements\" or \"Crazy\u00a0Cleanse\" type person...I'm on a eat right (sort of..most of the time..) and exercise kind of thing.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone feels like joining or is already a member we could start a Best Destination Group and inspire each other to \"start sweating for the wedding\"<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.myfitnesspal.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.myfitnesspal.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365774059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.136.80","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4d460022d837379ef2fda0d3967d9f6","RawContent":"I&#039;m on it, have been on and off for years.\n\n\nI&#039;ve found the only way I lose weight is by food tracking and running.  Neither which I enjoy lol.  My Crossfit gym is doing a Paleo challenge for the 3 weeks before the wedding, and while I&#039;m gone, and I figure it&#039;s a good way to motivate myself to eat more healthy.  It&#039;s unprocessed foods, focusing on protein\/veggies\/fruits\/good carbs. Not doing the whole30.  It&#039;s basically how I try to eat now, just no caffeine\/sugar.\n\n\nMfp is great for keeping you accountable. I&#039;d suggest not eating back calories, and overestimate when you can&#039;t exactly measure. And it&#039;s only good if you track everything, no cheating lol.\n\n\nI&#039;d be up for a group if you wanted to start it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1883893,"PostDate":1422040443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm on it, have been on and off for years.<br><br>\nI've found the only way I lose weight is by food tracking and running.  Neither which I enjoy lol.  My Crossfit gym is doing a Paleo challenge for the 3 weeks before the wedding, and while I'm gone, and I figure it's a good way to motivate myself to eat more healthy.  It's unprocessed foods, focusing on protein\/veggies\/fruits\/good carbs. Not doing the whole30.  It's basically how I try to eat now, just no caffeine\/sugar.<br><br>\nMfp is great for keeping you accountable. I'd suggest not eating back calories, and overestimate when you can't exactly measure. And it's only good if you track everything, no cheating lol.<br><br>\nI'd be up for a group if you wanted to start it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Underwater Trash The Dress Session Photos<\/strong> - Samuel Luna (Photographer)<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Resort Review<\/strong> - <em>Crown Paradise Club Cancun<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Photographer Review <\/strong>- <em>Samuel Luna<\/em> - Coming Soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Makeup\/Hair Artist Review\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0<em>Sara Tamargo<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Sale Items<\/strong> -\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387567052,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.231.76.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f51de2c9a7a26bb29afa421b306b961","RawContent":"@[member=\"marinah84\"] I will start one this weekend :) if I can figure out how to do it :) my user name is diaryofadillydallier\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1883894,"PostDate":1422041055,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"me