,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78668,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8812f9ee6f1c8cdab719be27b8f026b7","RawContent":"Fitbit.com - it&#039;s a brand of wearable activity trackers that track things like steps, floors climbed, distance, heart rate, sleep, etc, depending on the model.\n\n\nI loooove mine!  I just upgraded to the charge hr, which tracks so much more than my flex.  I love the heart rate tracking for my workouts and floors\/sleep tracking!\n\n\nI don&#039;t know my map username, I have it saved on my phone app. I think it&#039;s marinaherbert84 tho...lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1883920,"PostDate":1422060958,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Fitbit.com - it's a brand of wearable activity trackers that track things like steps, floors climbed, distance, heart rate, sleep, etc, depending on the model.<br><br>\nI loooove mine!  I just upgraded to the charge hr, which tracks so much more than my flex.  I love the heart rate tracking for my workouts and floors\/sleep tracking!<br><br>\nI don't know my map username, I have it saved on my phone app. I think it's marinaherbert84 tho...lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color